{% doc %}
Outputs unit only for Cottoceramix articles explicitly using whole sellable units.
The unit controller validates quantities and pack counts; an invalid opt-in must
not fall back to the unrelated generic delivery promise or an m² calculator.
@param {product} product - The article to inspect.
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign unit_vendor = product.vendor | strip | downcase
  if unit_vendor == 'cottoceramix' and product.metafields.custom.bron_toelichtingen_json.value.tiles.order_mode == 'unit'
    echo 'unit'
  endif
-%}
